    "body": "> When the XML-parser is interrupted (not sure when that happens, [@hsivonen](https://github.com/hsivonen) do you know?)\n\nMy understanding is that this happens:\n\n* On EOF\n* When a script blocks the parser.\n* When we've spent too much time occupying the main thread and building the tree and do a clock-based yield to the event loop.\n",
